B1. Three honest numbers for 'TTFT' on ONE request
==============================================================================

  ML engineer  gen_ai.server.time_to_first_token      15.34 ms
  SRE          time to first MESSAGE (transport)      37.26 ms
  Product      end to end, user-perceived           1121.45 ms

  offset model->transport: 21.92 ms = 142.9% of the model's number
  All three are correct. Nothing in any specification says which one an
  SLO is written against, and no two of them can be joined (see A3).

