==============================================================================

  NB: ml.tpot_p50 is the p50 across requests of each request's MEAN
      inter-token gap -- the way vLLM defines TPOT. The p50 of each
      request's MEDIAN gap is tracked alongside it to show the difference.

  baseline: ml.ttft 15.3  ml.tpot 1.762  sre.dur 1115.5  ask.ttfm 39.6  ask.gap_p99 27.95  ask.gap_worst 27.9

  fault                            ML ENGINEER   SRE (today)  SRE (w/ ask)       PRODUCT
  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  prefill regression (+40%)               SEES            --            --            --
  queue saturation (+250ms)               SEES          SEES          SEES          SEES
  slow consumer (20ms/msg)                SEES          SEES          SEES          SEES
  KV handoff +150ms (disagg)                --            --          SEES            --
  one 400ms decode stall                  SEES          SEES          SEES          SEES
  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  ML ENGINEER    detects 4/5 faults
  SRE (today)    detects 3/5 faults
  SRE (w/ ask)   detects 4/5 faults
  PRODUCT        detects 3/5 faults

